Intoduction 
  As a Student Digital Ambassador, I decided to create a visual infographic on a single page using Canva to assist my fellow students in understanding the importance of digital literacy. My visual infographic visually represents the three major pillars of digital literacy, which include a clear meaning of digital literacy, useful digital tools for students, and safe internet practices. In-order to attract the attention of first-year students, I decided to use a contemporary design with clear icons and bullet points. 
